2
00:00:08,333 --> 00:00:12,174
A Dockerfile that builds and runs is a starting point.

3
00:00:12,174 --> 00:00:19,785
A production Dockerfile also makes the image small, safe, fast to rebuild, easy to operate and predictable:

4
00:00:19,785 --> 00:00:25,618
a pinned base image, dependencies installed from the lock file in their own layer,

5
00:00:25,618 --> 00:00:29,459
only the files the application needs, a non-root user,

6
00:00:29,459 --> 00:00:36,643
a healthcheck, metadata labels, and an exec-form command so the application receives the stop signal.

7
00:00:36,643 --> 00:00:43,898
