119
00:09:15,067 --> 00:09:18,021
What should I know about security review?

120
00:09:18,567 --> 00:09:21,837
Before an image and its deployment go to production,

121
00:09:21,837 --> 00:09:24,416
someone reviews them against a checklist,

122
00:09:24,416 --> 00:09:29,070
and proves every finding with a command instead of guessing from the file.

123
00:09:29,070 --> 00:09:33,662
In this lesson you review a real Dockerfile and Compose file that "work",

