00:10:32,850 --> 00:10:40,491
The first hardening attempt (broken/compose.yaml) makes the proxy's file system read-only.

143
00:10:41,033 --> 00:10:51,373
Nginx creates temporary directories under /var/cache/nginx (for proxied responses) and writes its PID file under /run at startup.

144
00:10:51,373 --> 00:10:52,575
