150
00:11:17,780 --> 00:11:20,531
What do I need to remember?

151
00:11:21,067 --> 00:11:29,201
Review with a checklist and prove every finding with a command (inspect, history, run, compose config).

152
00:11:29,767 --> 00:11:31,266
Common findings:

153
00:11:31,266 --> 00:11:40,546
root user, secrets in ENV/ARG, extra tools, privileged mode, the Docker socket, published database.

154
00:11:41,100 --> 00:11:45,877
Harden with USER, secret files, read_only, cap_drop:

155
00:11:45,877 --> 00:11:49,734
[ALL], no-new-privileges, resource limits.
